WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:19,780
How legitimate are meridians and chakras physically and spiritually. So meridians are just

00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:28,340
energy pathways that are used by acupuncturists. So an acupuncturist is looking at different

00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:36,780
acupuncture points that are along meridians. Now that's different than a chakra. So meridians

00:00:36,780 --> 00:00:45,500
are energy points on acupuncturists are on different meridians that are that are energy pathways. Now

00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:51,020
it used to be I used to have to say about 25 years ago that they're not measurable, but they are

00:00:51,020 --> 00:00:57,740
measurable now. You can actually measure those energy pathways. That is very physical and there's

00:00:57,740 --> 00:01:05,340
nothing spiritual about them. So acupuncture is not a spiritual technique. It's not a religious

00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:11,820
technique and there's no reason for Christians to not do acupuncture for the spiritual standpoint.

00:01:11,820 --> 00:01:16,620
Now it might be a reason to not go to an acupuncturist that's a Buddhist or something like that,

00:01:17,420 --> 00:01:23,100
but you don't, but the practice of acupuncture itself is not a spiritual practice.

00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:28,540
Chakras are a little controversial because that is a little bit different

00:01:29,420 --> 00:01:35,660
and that could be very spiritual. So I don't like to talk about chakras myself,

00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:45,260
so I don't discuss chakras and that is not measurable. The one would say, oh you could measure

00:01:45,260 --> 00:01:53,260
energy on the chakra. Well, that's really just that specific meridian. So I don't buy into the

00:01:53,260 --> 00:01:58,140
chakra thing. I think it's used by new ages and I'm not into that and I think that could be

00:01:58,140 --> 00:02:03,820
dangerous from a spiritual perspective. I do believe that as a believer, you could be protected

00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:07,820
from all of that and you don't have to worry about those things, but I do think we're supposed to

00:02:07,820 --> 00:02:18,300
use wisdom and I don't put ourselves up to practice occultic practice. So I would stay right from that.

